9/"}],"edited":{"user":"U01J7703PFT","ts":"1619422191.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T1kEB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f72a36d2-5548-41b8-9ec1-eb0c0751450c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"一応橋かける計画は昔からありますね。コスパが悪いのが難点。なんせ大隅半島側になにもないから・・・","ts":"1619421921.287500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/=x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c577a36-5050-4c55-8943-c7bbb76ef1ad","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ桜島はただの雑魚キャラなんでね・・・その横で眠っている桜島の真の姿（姶良カルデラ）がやばい","ts":"1619421887.287000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KkeF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c0465b5-e170-4f61-8c98-326e518b3a5b","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"橋とかトンネル付けちゃうと桜島フェリーが廃業になっちゃうので、当分やらなそうな気がします","ts":"1619421828.286000","thread_ts":"1619401289.276300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r6K9B"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"a25149d7-1ec9-4102-a36b-b9bfb6c95f2a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ときどき地図見ながら橋を架けたりトンネル掘ったりを妄想するけど、薩摩半島と早くつながればいいのにといつも思う","ts":"1619401289.276300","thread_ts":"1619401289.276300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tv7dZ"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"2bb3bd0b-6b43-4679-8e3d-5c85f8293068","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"むしろ定期的に程よくパワー放出してるから安全なんじゃねーの的な思想はあります\n火山の理論的にどうなのかはさっぱりでございますが","ts":"1619421501.284700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EYJ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba00e823-482e-4e10-9295-f8c0a37ee835","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"山体崩壊して津波が出る、とかじゃないなら距離ありますし、海ありますからね...","ts":"1619420482.283700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"us