V82Ec"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd6001a0-869b-41be-841a-55886388458e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"天変地異といえば、桜島噴火しましたね","ts":"1619400752.271900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QI2eU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"677ede02-3404-401f-b110-e8b3751bfeb9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"最大のリスクは米中開戦だろうなぁ(Fallout脳)","ts":"1619400696.271500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aYbH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23e3049d-c581-4983-a7ee-6e99f0bc04dc","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"アメリカは沈没せずに資本主義は沈没するー的な事態はありえるのかな〜","ts":"1619400692.271300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tt6f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9943a2c5-f8b0-455c-84b8-b3a2d3f6a15b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"イエローストーン噴火はあってもおかしくないと思う","ts":"1619400678.270800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jdrk0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18d7a658-bd32-4b65-bbfe-3d7eea24efb2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"実際はどっかの大陸規模で沈没になったら、環境激変で経済どころじゃなくなりそうだけどw","ts":"1619400638.269900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"me="}]},{"client_msg_id":"cddfa6ac-4f63-4bec-8ba2-4eafcc8df8f3","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"アメリカ沈んだら投資どころじゃなくなりそう","ts":"1619400566.269400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=KjG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ac770ee-e33a-4d2e-aa46-a9b53e304f8f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"フィクションとしては面白いけど、現実問題として日本以外(全部)沈没ってのはあり得ない。とはいえもっとも多い資産は日本円なんだよなw","ts":"1619400546.269300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+CPck"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28d2b600-9d8e-4a0a-